# Club & Grub - World 1, stage 1 co-op: "Vine Bridges" for two (designer DB1; docs/expansion/DESIGN.md D.9).
# The co-op file of levels/w1_l1.lvl (kind = coop, coop_of, coop_base_hash; never edit the solo file). The first co-op
# stage teaches the duo verbs gently: the egg and the x2 tablet by signs at the first checkpoint; gate 1 "hop" - the
# springy flower became a ledge 8 rows high at the lake shore: a Shoulder Hop gets one hero up, and he clubs the
# coiled vine at its edge down for his partner (the gift); gate 2 "plates" - a leapfrog of two plate doors
# through the Great Tree on the canopy road (A holds for B in the lower corridor, B holds for A in the upper one); two
# Shellback turtles guard the tree house; the x2 secret is the High Cache over the far treetop (a Totem rider's jump
# strike, painting 20). Bats and hoppers are loners (Expert).

